        "kicker": "A new chapter",
        "heading": "Rebuilding the dream in Canada",
        "text": "<p>In 2024, my family and I began a new chapter in Canada. Like many immigrants, starting over wasn't easy. I left behind familiarity, clients, and the business I had spent years building. I had to rebuild my brand from the ground up in a new country, while balancing motherhood and entrepreneurship.</p><p>There were moments of doubt, sleepless nights, and challenges that tested my resilience. But every stitch reminded me why I started. I wasn't just making clothes — I was preserving culture, celebrating African craftsmanship, and proving that dreams can thrive anywhere in the world.</p>",
